<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.kbd.title")}
        description="Kbd 是 RML 的键盘按键展示组件，标签为 PascalCase Kbd。构造器接受 Keystroke 类型，通过 key 属性解析（如 key=\"cmd-a\" 生成 Keystroke::parse）。RenderOnce 无 ElementId，平台自适应显示：macOS 显示 ⌘A 符号，Windows/Linux 显示 Ctrl+A 文本。适合快捷键提示、菜单项右侧键标识。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>修饰键 + 字母</h3>
                <p>key 属性接受 keystroke 字符串，由 Keystroke::parse 解析。多键组合用连字符分隔。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Kbd key="cmd-a" />
                    <Kbd key="ctrl-c" />
                    <Kbd key="ctrl-shift-c" />
                    <Kbd key="alt-tab" />
                    <Kbd key="cmd-shift-p" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>功能键</h3>
                <p>单独功能键也可展示，常用于帮助文档或操作提示。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Kbd key="enter" />
                    <Kbd key="escape" />
                    <Kbd key="backspace" />
                    <Kbd key="delete" />
                    <Kbd key="space" />
                    <Kbd key="tab" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>方向键</h3>
                <p>方向键用于导航类操作提示。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Kbd key="up" />
                    <Kbd key="down" />
                    <Kbd key="left" />
                    <Kbd key="right" />
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>样式变体</h3>
                <p>outline 属性切换为描边样式（透明背景 + 彩色边框），appearance 属性控制是否显示默认外观（false 时仅显示文本）。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Kbd key="cmd-a" />
                    <Kbd key="cmd-a" outline="" />
                    <Kbd key="cmd-a" appearance="false" />
                </div>
                <p>常用于菜单项右侧的快捷键提示：新建文件 cmd-N，保存 cmd-S。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>组合示例：快捷键面板</h3>
                <p>Kbd 常与文本组合展示，构成快捷键帮助面板或菜单项。结合 div + flex 实现对齐布局。</p>
                <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" gap="8px" style="max-width: 360px;">
                    <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" justify-content="space-between" align-items="center">
                        <span>新建文件</span>
                        <div class="button-row">
                            <Kbd key="cmd-n" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" justify-content="space-between" align-items="center">
                        <span>保存</span>
                        <div class="button-row">
                            <Kbd key="cmd-s" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div display="flex" flex-direction="row" justify-content="space-between" align-items="center">
                        <span>命令面板</span>
                        <div class="button-row">
                            <Kbd key="cmd-shift-p" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>

        <template slot="api">
            <h3>Kbd</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>另：outline / appearance 为布尔属性，来自 Kbd 组件自有方法。Kbd 不支持 size 属性，固定使用超小字号。</p>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
